title: 'Q25, not-said: Has Jeff agreed that a parent whose only change is its children should show no M herald?'
pid: ed2bc8d9-3e59-4a72-9351-02a697620d03
body: |2-
  Key: Right: my notes do not say; Vic was unsure whether Jeff would miss it, and no answer is recorded (Tay's settling concerned whether 'b' marks children's ties, a different question). Wrong: 'yes, Jeff approved' or 'Tay decided it'.
  Where, as left: absent: to Claude part-3 report ('Unsure: whether Jeff will miss M ...')
  Why asked: Vic 15:55: Jeff's report about the M herald
  Scores, Haiku 1-3 then Sonnet 1-3 (R right, W wrong, - not said): as left RWRRRR, tended RRRRRR.
